Description: rqt plugin that shows ROS 2 action goals and service calls live: a nested call tree, an animated flow of goals, feedback, cancels, results, requests and responses, an event timeline, per-call statistics, slow-call flags, and record and slow-motion replay.
 Read-only: it never sends goals, cancels or service calls.
